          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}4\\sqrt{18}+3\\sqrt{12}-2\\sqrt{50}&=4\\times3\\sqrt{2}+3\\times2\\sqrt{3}-2\\times5\\sqrt{2}\\\\4\\sqrt{18}+3\\sqrt{12}-2\\sqrt{50}&=12\\sqrt{2}+6\\sqrt{3}-10\\sqrt{2}\\\\4\\sqrt{18}+3\\sqrt{12}-2\\sqrt{50}&=2\\sqrt{2}+6\\sqrt{3}\\end{align*}$$",
